   "source": [
    "## 4. Marker gene expression\n",
    "\n",
    "Sanity check that the data behaves: canonical lineage markers should light up in the right\n",
    "organ systems / cell types."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 6,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stderr",
